Z||000000||danny boy||06-09-2001||04:31 AM|||| I just got back from the Hank III show. Thats Hank Williams the third, son of Hankwilliams Jr., Grandson of Hank Williams, Sr. It was great. He plays old Hank songs and a lot of origional stuff that has the Hank Sr sound. And helooks like him,too. <BR> So he gets on stage and says" We're gonna play an hour of country, then take a five minute break and come back and play an hour of the hard stuff". Ended up playing for about 3 1/2 hours all together. <BR>We met him at the last show and he was great. Very nice guy. His fiddle player invited us to the after show party which was cool. After the show we hung out with the fiddle player again but didn't st ay for the festivities.<BR> Man, Hank III and the Damn Band is great if you're into old school country. Check out their CD Rising Outlaw-some of the stuff you think its Hank Sr singing.<BR> Has anyone else heard him?<P>------------------<BR>don't push the A/c button.. it catches the car on fire      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/PFF_sig_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
